<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Install @@APP_TITLE@@</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 3em auto; padding: 0 1em; color: #222; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.4em; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.05em; margin-top: 2em; }
    .btn { display: block; background: #007aff; color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 1em; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin: 1em 0; }
    .btn.lan { background: #34c759; }
    .btn.ca { background: #8e8e93; }
    .meta { color: #666; font-size: .9em; }
    .note { background: #fff3cd; border: 1px solid #ffe08a; padding: .8em 1em; border-radius: 8px; font-size: .9em; }
    .hide { display: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Install @@APP_TITLE@@</h1>
  <p class="meta">@@BUNDLE_ID@@ &middot; v@@BUNDLE_VERSION@@</p>

  <a class="btn" href="itms-services://?action=download-manifest&amp;url=@@FUNNEL_URL@@/manifest-funnel.plist">Install via Tailscale (public)</a>

  <h2 class="@@LAN_HIDE@@">LAN install</h2>
  <a class="btn lan @@LAN_HIDE@@" href="itms-services://?action=download-manifest&amp;url=@@LAN_URL@@/manifest-lan.plist">Install via LAN</a>
  <p class="meta @@LAN_HIDE@@">First time only: trust the mkcert root CA, then retry.</p>
  <a class="btn ca @@LAN_HIDE@@" href="@@CA_URL@@">Download mkcert root CA</a>
  <p class="note @@LAN_HIDE@@">After downloading the CA: Settings &rarr; General &rarr; VPN &amp; Device Management &rarr; install the profile. Then Settings &rarr; General &rarr; About &rarr; Certificate Trust Settings &rarr; toggle it on.</p>

  <p class="note"><strong>Must open in Safari.</strong> If this page opened inside Telegram / Slack / Mail, long-press the button and pick &ldquo;Open in Safari&rdquo; &mdash; in-app browsers silently fail the OTA handoff.</p>
</body>
</html>
